        "title": "Memperbarui Variabel var",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Updating a variable",
            "id": 126281,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita sudah melihat bahwa variabel <code>var</code>, berbeda dari <code>let</code>, dapat mengubah dan memperbarui nilai yang disimpannya.</p><p>Gunakan tanda <code>=</code> untuk mengubah nilai dalam <code>status</code> dari <code>\"Watching Netflix\"</code> menjadi <code>\"Relaxing at the beach\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Watching Netflix&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Relaxing at the beach&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Relaxing at the beach\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "As often as we want",
            "id": 126282,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat memperbarui variabel <code>var</code> sesering yang kita mau.</p><p>Coba sendiri: ubah nilai <code>currentStatus</code> menjadi <code>\"Reading\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Watching Netflix&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Relaxing at the Beach&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Reading&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"126\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Relaxing at the Beach\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Reading\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>currentStatus</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"Reading\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Setting with other variables",
            "id": 126283,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita juga dapat memberikan variabel nilai dari variabel lain dengan menetapkan satu variabel ke variabel lainnya.</p><p>Berikan variabel <code>currentStatus</code> nilai <code>defaultStatus</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" defaultStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi there!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing football&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"currentStatus = defaultStatus\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Playing football&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi there!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>defaultStatus</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Last value",
            "id": 126284,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita memperbarui variabel, variabel tersebut melupakan nilai sebelumnya.</p><p>Tampilkan variabel <code>currentStatus</code> saat nilainya disetel ke <code>\"Playing football\"</code> dan saat nilainya disetel ke <code>\"Walking the dog\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing football&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Walking the dog&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var currentStatus\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Playing football\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Walking the dog\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>currentStatus</code>, diikuti oleh <code>currentStatus</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "The missing let keyword",
            "id": 126285,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Manakah dari baris kode berikut yang memperbarui variabel <code>currentStatus</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>currentStatus = \"Working out\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let currentStatus = \"Working out\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>currentStatus = \"Working out\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying a status",
            "id": 126286,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Watching Netflix&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Watching Netflix\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Watching Netflix</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>currentStatus</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Watching Netflix</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
