      {
        "id": 14222,
        "title": "Ekspresi String",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Adding string values",
            "id": 126293,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menjumlahkan nilai string dengan tanda <code>+</code>.</p><p>Tambahkan nilai <code>\"Followers:\"</code> dan <code>\"55\"</code> bersama-sama.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Followers:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying expressions",
            "id": 126294,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menyebut penjumlahan nilai string sebagai <strong>ekspresi</strong> karena menghasilkan satu nilai string.</p><p>Tambahkan ekspresi di antara tanda kurung <code>print()</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Followers:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Followers:55\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Followers:\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>+</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"55\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Expressions with variables",
            "id": 126295,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ketika ekspresi berisi variabel, ekspresi tersebut menggunakan nilai dalam variabel.</p><p>Buat ekspresi yang menjumlahkan nilai <code>\"Followers:\"</code> dan variabel <code>followers</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" followers = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&quot;Followers:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + followers\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Followers:\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>+</code>, dan terakhir <code>followers</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Display expression",
            "id": 126296,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menggunakan <code>print()</code> untuk melihat hasil ekspresi di Swift.</p><p>Tambahkan instruksi <code>print()</code> di sekitar ekspresi tersebut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numberOfFollowers = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Followers:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + numberOfFollowers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Followers:55\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Setting the result of an expression",
            "id": 126297,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Karena ekspresi menjadi nilai, kita bisa memberikannya kepada variabel seperti halnya nilai.</p><p>Simpan ekspresi <code>\"Posts:\" + \"13\"</code> dalam variabel <code>label</code> dan tampilkan di console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Posts:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;13&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(label)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Posts:13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Posts:\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>+</code>, lalu <code>\"13\"</code>, <code>label</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "The value of label",
            "id": 126298,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa nilai <code>label</code>?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Name:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Name:Joe\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Joe\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Name:Joe\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying nothing",
            "id": 126299,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Jon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;athan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Tidak ada apa-apa, karena tidak ada instruksi <code>print()</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>Jonathan</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tidak ada apa-apa, karena tidak ada instruksi <code>print()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Updating a variable",
            "id": 126300,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" username = \" /><text value=\"&quot;snoopdogg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Username: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + username)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Username: snoopdogg\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Username: snoopdogg</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>snoopdogg</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Username: snoopdogg</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Missing whitespace",
            "id": 126301,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kode ini menampilkan <code>SteveJobs</code> tanpa spasi di konsol?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steve&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jobs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"SteveJobs\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Karena <code>\"Steve\" + \"Jobs\"</code> menjumlahkan nilai-nilai tersebut tanpa spasi</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Karena <code>print()</code> tidak pernah menampilkan spasi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Karena <code>\"Steve\" + \"Jobs\"</code> menjumlahkan nilai-nilai tersebut tanpa spasi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
