        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Numbers have no quotes",
            "id": 126306,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ada juga jenis nilai lainnya, seperti <strong>angka</strong>, yang tidak diapit tanda kutip ganda.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numberOfLikes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Setting numbers",
            "id": 126307,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Angka memudahkan kamu melacak <strong>nilai numerik</strong>. Misalnya, jumlah suka pada postingan Facebook.</p><p>Buat variabel <code>numberOfLikes</code> dan atur nilainya menjadi <code>5</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numberOfLikes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(numberOfLikes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>let</code>, diikuti oleh <code>numberOfLikes</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Addition and subtraction",
            "id": 126308,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita juga bisa membuat ekspresi dengan angka. Kita menjumlahkan angka menggunakan tanda <code>+</code> dan mengurangkannya satu sama lain menggunakan tanda <code>-</code>.</p><p>Tampilkan <code>6</code> di console dengan menetapkan <code>numberOfLikes</code> ke <code>5 + 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numberOfLikes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(numberOfLikes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>, diikuti oleh <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiplication and division",
            "id": 126309,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menggunakan tanda <code>*</code> untuk mengalikan angka dan tanda <code>/</code> untuk membagi angka.</p><p>Ubah <code>0.5</code> menjadi nilai persennya dengan mengalikannya dengan <code>100</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" percent = \" /><text value=\"0.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(percent)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"x\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"50.0\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>*</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Calculating with variables",
            "id": 126310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ketika kita menyimpan angka dalam variabel, kita juga bisa menggunakan variabel tersebut untuk perhitungan.</p><p>Tambahkan <code>1</code> ke variabel <code>numberOfSteps</code> sebelum menampilkannya dalam fungsi print.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numberOfSteps = \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You're on step:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(numberOfSteps + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"You're on step:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"71\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>+</code>, diikuti oleh <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Calculate the total 3",
            "id": 126311,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Karena ekspresi menjadi nilai, kita bisa menyimpan hasil perhitungan dalam variabel.</p><p>Simpan hasil perhitungan dalam variabel <code>total</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" privatePosts = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" publicPosts = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = privatePosts + publicPosts\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Total posts:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(total)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Total posts:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>total</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>privatePosts + publicPosts</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
